{"metadata":{"externalID":"s:5Adyen23TwintSDKActionComponentC13ConfigurationV15maxIssuerNumberSivp","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"maxIssuerNumber"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Int"}],"symbolKind":"property","modules":[{"name":"Adyen"}],"role":"symbol","title":"maxIssuerNumber","roleHeading":"Instance Property"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/adyen.Adyen\/documentation\/Adyen\/TwintSDKActionComponent\/Configuration-swift.struct\/maxIssuerNumber","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/adyen.Adyen\/documentation\/Adyen","doc:\/\/adyen.Adyen\/documentation\/Adyen\/TwintSDKActionComponent","doc:\/\/adyen.Adyen\/documentation\/Adyen\/TwintSDKActionComponent\/Configuration-swift.struct"]]},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The issuer number of the highest scheme you listed under "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"LSApplicationQueriesSchemes"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"E.g. pass 39, if you listed all schemes from “twint-issuer1” up to and including “twint-issuer39”."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The value is clamped between 0 and 39."}],"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"maxIssuerNumber","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"name":"Important","type":"aside","style":"important","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"All apps above “twint-issuer39” will always be returned if one of these apps is installed."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"F